ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja428:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja428:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja428:11.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja428:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja428:0.2": "Navakanipāta ", "ja428:0.3": "Gijjhavagga ", "ja428:0.4": "2. Kosambiyajātaka ", "ja428:1.1": "“Puthusaddo samajano, ", "ja428:1.2": "na bālo koci maññatha; ", "ja428:1.3": "Saṅghasmiṁ bhijjamānasmiṁ, ", "ja428:1.4": "nāññaṁ bhiyyo amaññaruṁ. ", "ja428:2.1": "Parimuṭṭhā paṇḍitābhāsā, ", "ja428:2.2": "vācāgocarabhāṇino; ", "ja428:2.3": "Yāvicchanti mukhāyāmaṁ, ", "ja428:2.4": "yena nītā na taṁ vidū. ", "ja428:3.1": "Akkocchi maṁ avadhi maṁ, ", "ja428:3.2": "ajini maṁ ahāsi me; ", "ja428:3.3": "Ye ca taṁ upanayhanti, ", "ja428:3.4": "veraṁ tesaṁ na sammati. ", "ja428:4.1": "Akkocchi maṁ avadhi maṁ, ", "ja428:4.2": "ajini maṁ ahāsi me; ", "ja428:4.3": "Ye ca taṁ nupanayhanti, ", "ja428:4.4": "veraṁ tesūpasammati. ", "ja428:5.1": "Na hi verena verāni, ", "ja428:5.2": "sammantīdha kudācanaṁ; ", "ja428:5.3": "Averena ca sammanti, ", "ja428:5.4": "esa dhammo sanantano. ", "ja428:6.1": "Pare ca na vijānanti, ", "ja428:6.2": "mayamettha yamāmase; ", "ja428:6.3": "Ye ca tattha vijānanti, ", "ja428:6.4": "tato sammanti medhagā. ", "ja428:7.1": "Aṭṭhicchinnā pāṇaharā, ", "ja428:7.2": "gavāssa dhanahārino; ", "ja428:7.3": "Raṭṭhaṁ vilumpamānānaṁ, ", "ja428:7.4": "tesampi hoti saṅgati; ", "ja428:7.5": "Kasmā tumhāka no siyā. ", "ja428:8.1": "Sace labhetha nipakaṁ sahāyaṁ, ", "ja428:8.2": "Saddhiṁ caraṁ sādhuvihāridhīraṁ; ", "ja428:8.3": "Abhibhuyya sabbāni parissayāni, ", "ja428:8.4": "Careyya tenattamano satīmā. ", "ja428:9.1": "No ce labhetha nipakaṁ sahāyaṁ, ", "ja428:9.2": "Saddhiṁ caraṁ sādhuvihāridhīraṁ; ", "ja428:9.3": "Rājāva raṭṭhaṁ vijitaṁ pahāya, ", "ja428:9.4": "Eko care mātaṅgaraññeva nāgo. ", "ja428:10.1": "Ekassa caritaṁ seyyo, ", "ja428:10.2": "Natthi bāle sahāyatā; ", "ja428:10.3": "Eko care na pāpāni kayirā, ", "ja428:10.4": "Appossukko mātaṅgaraññeva nāgo”ti. ", "ja428:11.1": "Kosambiyajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja428:0.1": "", "ja428:0.2": "", "ja428:0.3": "", "ja428:0.4": "", "ja428:1.1": "", "ja428:1.2": "", "ja428:1.3": "", "ja428:1.4": "", "ja428:2.1": "", "ja428:2.2": "", "ja428:2.3": "", "ja428:2.4": "", "ja428:3.1": "", "ja428:3.2": "", "ja428:3.3": "", "ja428:3.4": "", "ja428:4.1": "", "ja428:4.2": "", "ja428:4.3": "", "ja428:4.4": "", "ja428:5.1": "", "ja428:5.2": "", "ja428:5.3": "", "ja428:5.4": "", "ja428:6.1": "", "ja428:6.2": "", "ja428:6.3": "", "ja428:6.4": "", "ja428:7.1": "", "ja428:7.2": "gavāssa → gavassa (mr) ", "ja428:7.3": "", "ja428:7.4": "", "ja428:7.5": "", "ja428:8.1": "", "ja428:8.2": "", "ja428:8.3": "", "ja428:8.4": "", "ja428:9.1": "", "ja428:9.2": "", "ja428:9.3": "", "ja428:9.4": "", "ja428:10.1": "", "ja428:10.2": "", "ja428:10.3": "", "ja428:10.4": "", "ja428:11.1": "Kosambiyajātakaṁ → kosambajātakaṁ (bj); kosambījātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja428:0.1": "", "ja428:0.2": "", "ja428:0.3": "", "ja428:0.4": "", "ja428:1.1": "bj30.326, csp1ed22.188, csp2ed22.188, ms22J_1791, msdiv10, pts-vp-pli3.488, vri68.154", "ja428:1.2": "", "ja428:1.3": "", "ja428:1.4": "", "ja428:2.1": "ms22J_1792, msdiv11", "ja428:2.2": "", "ja428:2.3": "", "ja428:2.4": "", "ja428:3.1": "ms22J_1793, msdiv12", "ja428:3.2": "", "ja428:3.3": "", "ja428:3.4": "", "ja428:4.1": "ms22J_1794, msdiv13", "ja428:4.2": "", "ja428:4.3": "", "ja428:4.4": "", "ja428:5.1": "ms22J_1795, msdiv14", "ja428:5.2": "", "ja428:5.3": "", "ja428:5.4": "", "ja428:6.1": "ms22J_1796, msdiv15", "ja428:6.2": "", "ja428:6.3": "", "ja428:6.4": "", "ja428:7.1": "dr27.254, ms22J_1797, msdiv16, sya27.255", "ja428: